    <TD STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Allowance for doubtful accounts</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-weight: bold"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
